  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></span></span></span></b></p><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 17px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 新細明體, serif; color: rgb(58, 90, 64);\">研究動機</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;近年來，都市環境對於居民身心健康影響議題，受到研究者與大眾的高度關注，由於受到全球都市化的影響，世界上有高比例的人口生活在都市，而且數量不斷在增加中。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;研究指出，人類在都市中的情緒感受，會隨著不同的空間與景觀元素產生變化，引發正向、負向&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 的情緒表達，因此透過理解使用者對環境的情緒反應，是改善當代公共環境品質的重要指標。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">由於環境健康指標的建立缺乏參考依據，目前在研究與實務操作仍出現斷層，因此本系統開發目的希望提供城市規劃與設計者，透過情緒地圖檢視城市各區的發展現況，從使用者的生、心理層面理解物理環境的需求，做為營造正向情緒之都市環境參考。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;\nmso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;\nmso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">本研究參考</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Russell and Pratt (1980)</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">環形情緒模型，評估人對於不同環境場景之情緒反應：環形情緒模型將人類的情緒表現，以四維度</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">正向、負向、反應強、反應弱</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">分出四個象限歸類，本系統以此為架構，選定主要八項情緒進行解析，透過色彩表達人對照片之情緒反應。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 新細明體, serif; color: rgb(58, 90, 64);\">網站架構</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">第一頁</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">照片導入</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-add-space:\nauto;text-indent:-24.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings\">l<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">使用者上傳一張帶有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">gps</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">定位環境照片（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">JPG\n/ PNG / WEBP</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">4MB </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">以下）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\ntext-indent:-24.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings\">l<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">選填場域類型（公園綠地</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> / </span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">水岸空間</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\n/ </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">辦公校園</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> / </span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">住宅庭院</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">\n/ </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">商業）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">第二頁</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">取得景觀元素與情緒分析結果</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:12.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:1.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(1)</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">提取照片中之景觀元素</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:2.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">a</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">植栽元素</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">喬木、灌木、草皮</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:2.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">b</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">藍帶元素</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">河流、噴泉、運河、水體</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:2.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">c</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">天際元素</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">天空、雲層</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:2.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">d</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">人工硬質</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">建築立面、鋪面、人行道</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:2.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">e</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">移動與活絡元素</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">行人、自行車、車輛</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:24.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:2.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">f</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">干擾視覺遮蔽</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">廣告看板、圍欄、電線桿</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:12.0pt;mso-para-margin-left:1.0gd\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(2)</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">以環形情緒理論提取</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">8 </span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">項情緒分析，參考</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">(Li-Chih\nHo et al.,2025)</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">人類在城市中對景觀元素之不同情緒反應</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"margin-left:48.0pt;mso-add-space:\nauto;text-indent:-24.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings\">l<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">對每項情緒進行</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">1-5</span><span style=\"font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">分評分並附上理由</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"margin-left:48.0pt;mso-add-space:auto;\ntext-indent:-24.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;\nmso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings\">l<span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">參照各情緒顏色及得分計算，合成代表情緒顏色</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\n&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:\nminor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">第三頁</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">: </span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">地圖呈現</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">依據照片</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">GPS</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;新細明體&quot;,serif;mso-ascii-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast;mso-hansi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">定位，自動將情緒色彩放入地圖中，呈現情緒色彩地圖</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 新細明體, serif; color: rgb(58, 90, 64);\">驗證計畫</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Times 